WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:03.805
Learn to create a problem for a given equation with one unknown

00:00:04.617 --> 00:00:10.562
Which word problem fits n plus 8 equals 57? The answer is Start with n stickers, get

00:00:10.562 --> 00:00:14.409
8 more, finish with 57. The plus sign shows an increase.

00:00:15.283 --> 00:00:19.886
Which equation would solve “An unknown number of beads, plus 11 more, makes 18”?

00:00:19.886 --> 00:00:22.515
Pause and solve it in your exercise book.

00:00:23.367 --> 00:00:29.008
The answer is n plus 11 equals 18. The unknown beads plus the added beads gives the

00:00:29.008 --> 00:00:29.340
total.
